STATEMENT: >>>
The root ``CMakeLists.txt`` builds a static ``zef`` library from five C11 source
files, exports ``include`` as its public include directory, enables warning
options, and registers one CTest executable named ``zef_smoke_test``. The
current build contains Debug and Release host configurations; no separate
configuration-fixture target appears in the repository.
