[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Message, Mailbox, and Machine implementation

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-010
TITLE: Fixed message pools and embedded envelope
STATEMENT: >>>
``src/zef_message.c`` initializes caller-provided aligned block storage as a
free list. Allocation selects the smallest initialized pool whose block size
contains ``sizeof(ZMsg) + payload_size``; equal sizes retain array order.
The allocated block begins with a complete ``ZMsg`` and places the
payload immediately after it. ``z_message_begin`` creates a dynamic Message
with one creator reference. ``z_message_static_init`` represents an immutable
caller-owned Message without a pool block.
<<<
COMMENT: Code references: include/zef.h; src/zef_message.c.
