[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-012
TITLE: Monotonic ring Mailbox
STATEMENT: >>>
``src/zef_mailbox.c`` stores caller-provided Message-pointer slots behind
monotonic ``head`` and ``tail`` counters. Normal posts consume a dynamic
Message, front posts decrement the head, and postpone retains an existing
Message before enqueueing it. Take transfers the queued reference to the
caller. Occupancy, free-space, minimum-free-space, and predicate-based stable
removal operate directly on the bounded ring without general-purpose
allocation.
<<<
