[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-013
TITLE: Timer-private messages and mailbox layout
STATEMENT: >>>
Each public ``ZMailbox`` stores only its configured Message pointer slots.
Timers create or embed a private Message and enqueue that same Message for
each expiration. Cancellation removes matching private Message pointers using
the bounded mailbox removal operation, so no per-slot timer owner metadata or
dynamic allocation is required.
<<<
