[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-021
TITLE: Runtime state consistency validation
STATEMENT: >>>
Machine initialization checks the non-null root, root-parent relationship, and
parent cycles. Runtime startup and transition validation check initial-child
relationships and that transition targets reach the configured root within the
depth limit.
Startup and dispatch track explicit lifecycle flags; startup enters the root
and follows initial links, while a self-transition leaves and re-enters the
current node before following its initial links.
<<<
