[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Actor composition

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-031
TITLE: Actor convenience implementation
STATEMENT: >>>
``src/zef_actor.c`` initializes a caller-owned ``ZActor`` by composing its
embedded Machine, Mailbox, and Reactor in dependency order. The implementation
passes through the application's state root, context, and Mailbox slot storage,
then forwards registration and start to the existing Reactor APIs. It performs
no allocation and adds no scheduler state.
<<<
