[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-050
TITLE: Bitmap topic table and ordered publication
STATEMENT: >>>
``ZTopicTable`` stores one 32-bit subscriber bitmap per configured topic and a
pointer to its Kernel. Subscription changes and publication snapshots enter
and leave the Port critical section. Publication consumes the sender pointer,
snapshots subscribers, then scans Reactor identities from high to low and
enqueues the same Message in strict priority order while retaining references
for later recipients. The dense case uses the high-water identity bound
and does not allocate or sort a recipient list; unregistered identity gaps are
skipped by the bitmap.
<<<
COMMENT: Code references: include/zef.h; src/zef_kernel.c.
