[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-072
TITLE: Shared-stack activation status
STATEMENT: >>>
No per-Reactor process stacks or callee-saved register switching appear in the
current tree. The scheduler's portable activation path tracks whether a newly
runnable Reactor can preempt the active priority and provides an internal
higher-priority activation entry point. The target Port now supplies the
exception-frame boundary; the build-time execution mode controls whether its
PendSV activation machinery is emitted. Cooperative mode remains the default.
<<<
