STATEMENT: >>>
The public API is exposed in ``include/zef.h`` and its interrupt-context
classification is described in ``docs/api-requirements.sdoc``. The current C
headers contain no compiler annotations or separately named ISR variants; the
implementation relies on the bounded fixed-storage code paths and the
documented caller context.
